      "id": "382c5bf8ba0dbbe0893ee55eb3662b62744d907419355b2274aa943a5c07abab",
      "title": "It’s been a great year for investigative reporting. But there’s a catch.",
      "url": "https://mailchi.mp/poynter/its-been-a-great-year-for-investigative-reporting-but-theres-a-catch",
      "category": "uncategorized",
