      "id": "9963e3bc020f262887eb3c866e8c699ece6d522dc07817499b1a217e5d2c2a9e",
      "title": "It’s been a great year for investigative reporting. But there’s a catch.",
      "url": "https://politifact.com/article/2026/nov/10/trump-stephen-miller-deportation-immigration",
