otion , Nov. 8, 2026 White House, Statement to PolitiFact, Nov. 9, 2026 National Immigration Project, Court strikes down Remain in Mexico policy , October 9, 2026 San Francisco Chronicle, Remain in Mexico policy suffers setback, Oct. 14, 2026 Law 360, Calif. Judge Vacates Trump Admin’s ‘Remain In Mexico’ Policy, Oct. 8, 2026 Associated Press, Trump open to talking to Democrats on immigration after midterms, but Mullin stresses no amnesty , Nov. 9, 2026 White House, Statement to PolitiFact, Nov. 9, 2026 Email Interview with Deportation Data Project, Nov. 9, 2026 Politico, Supreme Court allows Trump’s Big Bend construction to continue , Nov. 9, 2026 The New York Times, Supreme Court Allows Construction of Trump’s Border Wall in Big Bend , Nov. 9, 2026 Migration Policy Institute, U.S. Deportations and “Self-Deportations” in the First 18 Months of the Second Trump Term , October 2026 US Border Patrol RGV Sector, Facebook post , April 7, 2026 Roll Call, Press Conference: Donald Trump Holds an Impromptu News Conference , Nov. 9, 2026 AP, After saying deportation policy was too tough, Trump now says it’s ‘very strong,’ rejects ‘amnesty’ Nov. 9, 2026 Telephone interview, David B. Thronson, Michigan State University law professor, Nov. 9, 2026 Email interview, Tom K. Wong, political science associate professor, director of the U.S. Immigration Policy Center at the University of California, San Diego, Nov. 9, 2026 Email interview, Elizabeth Cohen, professor of United States Citizenship, political science department, Boston University, Nov. 9, 2026 Email interview, Nathalye Cotrino Villarreal, Human Rights Watch senior researcher, Nov. 10, 2026 Email interview with DHS’ spokesperson, Nov. 10, 2026 Sign Up For Our Weekly Newsletter Sign Up Browse the Truth-O-Meter More by Maria Briceño X posts stated on November 1, 2026 in post: Footage of the Nov. 1 plane crash in Palm Beach County, Florida, “was 100%” generated with artificial intelligence. By Maria Briceño &bull; November 2,